# Handwritten Image Classifier & CalmDigit (Mood Visualizer)

Two Streamlit apps powered by a compact CNN trained on MNIST:

1. **Digit Classifier (`app.py`)** — predicts the digit in an uploaded image or on-canvas drawing.  
2. **CalmDigit (`mood.py`)** — you draw a number (0–9) as your energy level; the app turns it into a mood card + a short “calm & reflect” flow and can learn from your corrections.

> Educational demo — not a medical tool.

---

## 🌐 Live Demos

- Digit Classifier: https://handwritten-image-classifier-gnvfmpuqqsabwve3e8fysf.streamlit.app/
- CalmDigit: https://handwritten-image-classifier-5ylaqfpgvmrrnrsc4viz77.streamlit.app/
